Plugin settings: don't offer Save & Apply for a delete, or while one runs.
Deleting a plugin removed its row at once, which showed Save & Apply. The
delete only reaches the backend after a 5-second cancellation window, and
saving reloads the page, so saving in that window abandoned the delete. A
removed row is no longer a change to save, since a delete reloads the page
itself once it succeeds, and Save & Apply stays disabled while any delete is
in flight.

